WEBVTT

00:01:28.637 --> 00:01:32.097
Aren't you afraid that you're going
to work your whole life at this craft

00:01:32.121 --> 00:01:33.977
and nothing's ever going to come of it

00:01:34.001 --> 00:01:36.636
and you're going to die
on a scrap heap of broken dreams

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:39.127
with your mouth filled
with bitter ash of failure?"

00:01:39.151 --> 00:01:40.480
(Laughter)

00:01:40.504 --> 00:01:42.332
Like that, you know.

00:01:42.356 --> 00:01:47.493
The answer -- the short answer
to all those questions is, "Yes."

00:01:47.517 --> 00:01:49.793
Yes, I'm afraid of all those things.

00:01:49.817 --> 00:01:51.058
And I always have been.

00:01:51.082 --> 00:01:53.368
And I'm afraid of many,
many more things besides

00:01:53.392 --> 00:01:55.293
that people can't even guess at,

00:01:55.317 --> 00:01:59.274
like seaweed and other
things that are scary.

00:01:59.298 --> 00:02:01.525
But, when it comes to writing,